# Nothing is required here: the API is same-origin (proxied in dev - see
# vite.config.ts) and the Casdoor settings come from the API at runtime
# (/config.js), from its CASDOOR_ENDPOINT / CASDOOR_CLIENT_ID.
#
# Optional: where the Vite dev server proxies API requests to.
# KFAMILY_API_URL=http://localhost:8080
